  "description": "A feature-rich Zoom and Pan control for WPF. Supports animated zoom, mouse-wheel zoom, click-drag pan, drag-to-zoom, fit/fill, undo/redo, ScrollViewer integration (IScrollInfo), a minimap (ZoomAndPanViewBox), and MVVM-friendly commands and bindings. Targets .NET 6, 7, 8, and 10 (Windows).",
